# Brandfetch Logo API client ID — free tier, get one at https://developers.brandfetch.com
# Used client-side to embed real company logos on the Stock Research hero card.
# Without it, Stockproof falls back to a generated letter avatar (never a broken image).
# Set the real value in .env.local (gitignored) — not here.
VITE_BRANDFETCH_CLIENT_ID=
